ns behind benefit decisions."}]}, {"id": "8f5da693-22bd-4644-90d1-290298671611", "type": "topic", "title": "Executive Compensation and Governance", "description": "This unit introduces executive pay as a specialized area where incentives, governance, disclosure, fairness, and public legitimacy collide.", "children": [{"id": "68cee092-1d39-4ed6-90f4-a6fc136a832d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Executive pay components", "children": [{"id": "aa984a31-4b34-4f57-8f2d-7c6f6e3f2b4a", "type": "concept", "title": "base salary"}, {"id": "e9862af6-8ccc-4540-8502-053a0894abcb", "type": "concept", "title": "annual incentives"}, {"id": "b8bcb24d-490b-439a-84d0-7b7c216cebd4", "type": "concept", "title": "long-term incentives"}, {"id": "eccca6b7-1da3-4429-8378-590cc3ddc82d", "type": "concept", "title": "equity awards"}, {"id": "66da5bde-3b9d-4bc1-9c92-977e71599b22", "type": "concept", "title": "perquisites"}], "description": "Students learn the common building blocks of executive compensation and why each exists."}, {"id": "d715bbac-39a8-4e50-9cdf-b4610dc35f66", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Governance and oversight", "children": [{"id": "f19825c8-8c77-4658-b628-b088a2189b98", "type": "concept", "title": "compensation committee"}, {"id": "5287ed87-b3d7-4751-880b-e88fc0fd370f", "type": "concept", "title": "say-on-pay"}, {"id": "d6e31061-3595-4f7b-acb6-8a2f127052d6", "type": "concept", "title": "peer groups"}, {"id": "3df1dd22-cf6d-4ba1-91a9-220c9cb943b7", "type": "concept", "title": "proxy disclosure"}, {"id": "33dda4a3-8247-4699-a7a7-5c6300acf6a3", "type": "concept", "title": "consultant independence"}], "description": "The class explains the roles of boards, compensation committees, consultants, and disclosure rules."}, {"id": "f7bfe5e5-db59-4e7f-8b46-758c0090066d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Risk and fairness debates", "children": [{"id": "336b66b5-3ae9-4ba1-816d-b51a08e4f2eb", "type": "concept", "title": "pay-performance alignment"}, {"id": "5e12a94a-dc68-4aa2-9649-56f75b15601b", "type": "concept", "title": "risk-taking"}, {"id": "7fd62bc2-8231-4739-a6f8-9ab06cd56a90", "type": "concept", "title": "internal pay ratios"}, {"id": "32d5bd66-aaa3-43dc-bd0d-290d4abac1cf", "type": "concept", "title": "retention concerns"}, {"id": "7298ad0b-d610-46ba-b679-0baa611edb06", "type": "concept", "title": "reputational risk"}], "description": "Students analyze how executive pay can support strategy or undermine trust."}]}, {"id": "59119021-451e-4ceb-a6b4-909c03d8f242", "type": "topic", "title": "Pay Equity, Pay Transparency, and Inclusive Rewards", "description": "Students learn how reward systems can reproduce inequality and how rigorous design, analysis, and communication can reduce inequitable outcomes.", "children": [{"id": "dfb5f54e-ac3f-4c84-bb7d-59a99dd3a4aa", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Pay equity analysis", "children": [{"id": "5e2ae9ea-ccee-4051-88aa-e88f99af7742", "type": "concept", "title": "similarly situated groups"}, {"id": "f8f89bce-7364-44d2-802c-d8d19b1134bf", "type": "concept", "title": "compa-ratio"}, {"id": "59140a1b-3c70-4f09-bfce-91c67edc0fdd", "type": "concept", "title": "regression basics"}, {"id": "2766eb2e-69eb-45c4-a734-c5b1b2ab6997", "type": "concept", "title": "unexplained gaps"}, {"id": "888a53df-f352-47fd-87f3-ea156017cb08", "type": "concept", "title": "remediation planning"}], "description": "Students learn the logic of comparing similarly situated employees while controlling for legitimate pay factors."}, {"id": "89184c7c-3c07-4fd7-9be6-7e429db77155", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Pay transparency", "children": [{"id": "6e561b6c-1a80-4487-ae71-de3259769d03", "type": "concept", "title": "salary-range posting"}, {"id": "7a90a2bb-093d-468e-886d-53b921247ed2", "type": "concept", "title": "employee access to ranges"}, {"id": "1681a3d5-83f9-4a6c-a208-624ca7d44123", "type": "concept", "title": "manager talking points"}, {"id": "8e6e620c-b7d1-437e-ba08-68a535161e41", "type": "concept", "title": "transparency readiness"}, {"